rule late_flag v1
description "Flags a return as late from the day it is due, which may be missing. The rows are tried in order, and `not: 2026-07-01` takes a return with no day before the row written for it is reached"

inputs
  due : date?  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-12-31

outputs
  late : bool

table pick
policy first
| due              | -> late : bool |
| not: 2026-07-01  | false          |
| none             | true           |
| 2026-07-01       | true           |
